#### Server Response
The server processes the form data and returns a list of filtered circulars. The server might use a database query to fetch the circulars based on the specified filters.

#### Data Display
The filtered circulars are displayed on the page. Each circular is represented by a card or a list item, and the user can interact with them (e.g., open, close, view details).

